nwc2musescore — Attributions
=============================

The NWC binary format is undocumented. The structure used by `nwc-parse`
(in particular `crates/nwc-parse/src/header.rs` and
`crates/nwc-parse/src/v2/body.rs`) was derived from the BSD-3-Clause-licensed
file `music21/noteworthy/binaryTranslate.py` in the
[music21](https://github.com/cuthbertLab/music21) project,
Copyright © 2006-2013 Michael Scott Asato Cuthbert.

The Rust implementation is original code, but the field layout, object-type
table, and parsing strategy follow that reference. The original file's BSD
licence is reproduced below for attribution; the per-file `License` comment
in this repository is MIT OR Apache-2.0 (this project's licence) since none
of the music21 source code is used verbatim.

